This is a mmcif format file writen by the programm fpocket.                 
It represents the atoms contacted by the voronoi vertices of the pocket.  
                                                                           
Information about the pocket    70:
0  - Pocket Score                      : -0.2000
1  - Drug Score                        : 0.0005
2  - Number of alpha spheres           :    15
3  - Mean alpha-sphere radius          : 4.2443
4  - Mean alpha-sphere Solvent Acc.    : 0.6249
5  - Mean B-factor of pocket residues  : 0.9677
6  - Hydrophobicity Score              : 7.6000
7  - Polarity Score                    :     5
8  - Amino Acid based volume Score     : 4.2000
9  - Pocket volume (Monte Carlo)       : 270.7090
10  -Pocket volume (convex hull)       : 7.2073
11 - Charge Score                      :     2
12 - Local hydrophobic density Score   : 8.0000
13 - Number of apolar alpha sphere     :     9
14 - Proportion of apolar alpha sphere : 0.6000
